# Seasonal Theme Notes

Use these query params to preview each holiday style on any storefront page.

Example:
- `http://localhost:3000/?season=valentines`
- `http://localhost:3000/products/example-item?season=christmas`

Note:
- Season override is stored in localStorage (`eyevaSeasonOverride`).
- To clear override, open a page with `?season=default`.

## Holiday Date Rules + Preview Links

| Season | Live Date Rule | Preview Link |
|---|---|---|
| Valentines | Feb 14 only | `?season=valentines` |
| St. Patrick's Day | Mar 17 only | `?season=stpatricks` |
| Easter Weekend | Good Friday through Easter Sunday | `?season=easter-weekend` |
| Mother's Day Weekend | Weekend containing 2nd Sunday in May (US) | `?season=mothers-day-weekend` |
| Father's Day Weekend | Weekend containing 3rd Sunday in June (US) | `?season=fathers-day-weekend` |
| Independence Day Weekend | Friday-Monday containing July 4 | `?season=independence-day-weekend` |
| Memorial Day Weekend | Friday-Monday around the last Monday in May (Independence Day colors) | `?season=memorial-day-weekend` |
| Labor Day Weekend | Friday-Monday around the first Monday in September (Independence Day colors) | `?season=labor-day-weekend` |
| Halloween | Oct 30 through Nov 2 | `?season=halloween` |
| Breast Cancer Awareness Day | Oct 1 only | `?season=breast-cancer-awareness-day` |
| Veterans Day | Nov 11 only (Independence Day colors) | `?season=veterans-day` |
| Thanksgiving | 4th Thursday in November, that day only (wins over Black Friday week) | `?season=thanksgiving` |
| Black Friday Sale | Monday-Sunday week containing Black Friday | `?season=black-friday-sale` |
| Cyber Monday Sale | Monday-Sunday week immediately after Black Friday week | `?season=cyber-monday-sale` |
| Christmas | Dec 22 through Dec 26 | `?season=christmas` |
| New Year's | Dec 31 and Jan 1 | `?season=new-years` |
| Autism Awareness Day | Apr 2 only (World Autism Awareness Day) | `?season=autism-awareness-day` |
| Earth Day | Apr 22 only (St. Patrick's Day colors) | `?season=earth-day` |
| Firefighters Day | May 4 only (International Firefighters' Day) | `?season=firefighters-day` |
| Armed Forces Day | 3rd Saturday in May (Independence Day colors) | `?season=armed-forces-day` |
| Police Week | Sunday-Saturday week containing May 15 | `?season=police-week` |
| EMS Week | Sunday-Saturday week starting the 3rd Sunday in May | `?season=ems-week` |
| Company Anniversary | Sept 17 (`COMPANY_ANNIVERSARY` in the three files below) | `?season=anniversary` |
| Default (no holiday) | Any other date | `?season=default` |

If two rules overlap, the one listed first in `resolveSeasonFromDate` wins (single days beat weeks, and Mother's Day and Memorial Day weekends beat Police and EMS Week).

Date rules live in three places that must be kept in sync: `assets/js/theme/global/seasonal-theme.js`, the inline script in `templates/layout/base.html`, and `templates/pages/checkout.html` (fixed dates only, no weekend/week rules).

